{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37162","headline":"东归诗 · 卢尚卿","name":"东归诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重丹诏下尘埃，深锁文闱罢选才。\n桂树放教遮月长，杏园终待隔年开。\n自从玉帐论兵後，不许金门谏猎来。\n今日灞陵桥上过，路人应笑腊前回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢尚卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}